# Decision Tree (Cursor mirror of rules/04-decision-tree.md)

> Canonical source: `rules/04-decision-tree.md`. If they differ, canonical wins.

1. Always search Modern Web Guidance first (platform concern).
2. Check project state: `@astryxdesign/core` in package.json → Astryx project.
   `components.json` + `components/ui/` → shadcn project. Neither → new project.
3. Pick ONE component system:
   - Astryx project → Astryx. shadcn project → shadcn.
   - New project → Astryx (default) unless user says shadcn.
   - AI Elements (chat/prompt/reasoning) → shadcn AI Elements.
   - Astryx has no equivalent (verified via CLI) → shadcn for that piece only.
4. One screen = one system. Mixing needs explicit user approval.
5. Neither covers it → show empty search results, stop, ask user. Never invent.

Always include a one-line Decision Log in your response.
